SUMMARY:AI for Alignment + Safety (AIAS) Launch
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the launch of Princeton AI Alignment + Safety\, a
  new research initiative dedicated to developing the scientific foundati
 ons needed to make increasingly capable artificial intelligence safe and
  beneficial to humanity. As AI systems advance toward and beyond human-l
 evel capabilities\, ensuring that they remain aligned with human values 
 and societal well-being presents fundamental scientific and technical ch
 allenges. Princeton AI Alignment + Safety brings together research acros
 s machine learning\, theoretical computer science\, game theory\, optimi
 zation\, control\, and economics to addres\nhttps://www.princeton.edu/ev
 ents/2026/ai-alignment-safety-aias-launch
URL:https://www.princeton.edu/events/2026/ai-alignment-safety-aias-launch
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
