SUMMARY:Research Data Stewardship Series: Documentation and Metadata
DESCRIPTION:Have you ever returned to a research project at a later date 
 and can’t seem to remember certain details that would allow you to reu
 se or replicate your own data? Need others to understand and use your da
 ta? Data documentation and metadata are practices you can put into place
  to help others\, including future you! This workshop will cover the fun
 damentals of data documentation (including standardized metadata)\, expl
 ain the principles behind the recommended practices\, and prepare you to
  streamline your own processes of data documentation. The Research Data 
 Stewardship series consists of four lect\nhttps://www.princeton.edu/even
 ts/2026/research-data-stewardship-series-documentation-and-metadata-0
URL:https://www.princeton.edu/events/2026/research-data-stewardship-serie
 s-documentation-and-metadata-0
