SUMMARY:Opening Night World Premiere of L’Hôtel Ritz de Paris
DESCRIPTION:LCA Resident Music Director and Composer Vince di Mura presen
 ts the world premiere of his new mega opus L'Hotel Ritz de Paris with th
 e Capital Philharmonic of New Jersey (CPNJ)\, where he is composer-in-re
 sidence.Step inside the legendary Hôtel Ritz Paris and hear the drama\,
  glamour\, courage\, and resistance of World War II at the Capital Philh
 armonic’s Opening Night event! L’Hôtel Ritz de Paris blends orchest
 ral composition with a live Cuban music ensemble\, solo violin\, cabaret
  and Latin influences through symphonic storytelling. The evening also o
 pens with Harmony Villa\, a new work that celebr\nhttps://www.princeton.
 edu/events/2026/opening-night-world-premiere-lhotel-ritz-de-paris
