SUMMARY:Magic: The Gathering Club Meeting
DESCRIPTION:Princeton Magic: The Gathering Club meets every Saturday at 7
 PM in JRR A98 for a night of Commander games\, free draft\, and good com
 pany. Whether you've never touched a Magic card or you've got a stack of
  decks at home\, there's a place for you at the table — we've got begi
 nner kits with ready-to-play Standard decks and members happy to walk yo
 u through your first game step by step. New this semester\, we're puttin
 g extra focus on welcoming beginners: no experience\, no cards\, and no 
 prior knowledge needed\, just come with curiosity. Come for the free pac
 ks\, stay for the friendly competition and th\nhttps://www.princeton.edu
 /events/2026/magic-gathering-club-meeting-6
URL:https://www.princeton.edu/events/2026/magic-gathering-club-meeting-6
STATUS:CONFIRMED
