 classes\, as well as by researchers from all over the world. The open ho
 use is a unique\, after-hours opportunity to visit the Special Collectio
 ns Reading Room and to learn about items newly added to Princeton’s re
 nowned Special Collections. In addition to viewing materials up close\, 
